{"path":"locale/isspace","title":"std::isspace(std::locale)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>isspace<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::locale)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/locale/isspace","section":"locale","kind":"page","summary":"Checks if the given character is classified as a whitespace character by the given locale's std::ctype facet.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/locale\">&lt;locale&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> isspace<span class=\"br0\">(</span> CharT ch, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> locale<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> loc <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks if the given character is classified as a whitespace character by the given locale's <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/ctype\">std::ctype</a></span> facet.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> ch\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> character\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> loc\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> locale\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the character is classified as a whitespace character, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Possible_implementation\">Possible implementation</h3>\n<table class=\"eq-fun-cpp-table\">\n<tr>\n<td>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> isspace<span class=\"br0\">(</span>CharT ch, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> loc<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/use_facet\"><span class=\"kw1914\">std::<span class=\"me2\">use_facet</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/ctype\"><span class=\"kw1955\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ctype</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>loc<span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">is</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/ctype_base\"><span class=\"kw1920\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ctype_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">space</span></span></a>, ch<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>Demonstrates the use of <code>std::isspace()</code> with different locales (OS-specific).</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> try_with<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span> c, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> loc<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1776\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wcout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"isspace('\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> c <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"', locale(<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> loc <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>)) returned \"</span>\n               <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\"><span class=\"kw1781\">std::<span class=\"me2\">boolalpha</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/isspace\"><span class=\"kw3613\">std::<span class=\"me2\">isspace</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c, <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>loc<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span> EM_SPACE <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> L<span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es3\">\\u2003</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// Unicode character 'EM SPACE'</span>\n    try_with<span class=\"br0\">(</span>EM_SPACE, <span class=\"st0\">\"C\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    try_with<span class=\"br0\">(</span>EM_SPACE, <span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.UTF8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>isspace(' ', locale(\"C\")) returned false\nisspace(' ', locale(\"en_US.UTF8\")) returned true</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/isspace\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>isspace</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks if a character is a space character <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide/iswspace\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>iswspace</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks if a wide character is a space character <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Possible implementation","id":"Possible_implementation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::isspace(std::locale)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Checks if the given character is classified as a whitespace character by the given locale's std::ctype facet."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"ch, loc"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Returns true if the character is classified as a whitespace character, false otherwise."},{"label":"Possible implementation"},{"label":"Example","note":"Demonstrates the use of std::isspace() with different locales (OS-specific)."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"isspace","note":"checks if a character is a space character"},{"label":"iswspace","note":"checks if a wide character is a space character"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":165,"codeBlockCount":3}
